  "notes": "{高騰|こうとう}する functions as a suru-verb meaning \"to soar\" or \"to skyrocket.\"\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {物価|ぶっか}が{高騰|こうとう}する (prices soar)\n- {地価|ちか}の{高騰|こうとう} (soaring land prices)\n- {株価|かぶか}が{高騰|こうとう}する (stock prices surge)\n- {原油|げんゆ}{価格|かかく}の{高騰|こうとう} (surge in oil prices)\n\nStronger than {値上|ねあ}がり (price increase), which can be moderate. {高騰|こうとう} implies a sharp, dramatic rise. The opposite is {暴落|ぼうらく} (crash, plunge).",
